Use Case: Production-Ready PLC Log Monitoring Automation System
Industry Scenario

A manufacturing company has multiple PLC-controlled machines generating alarm logs continuously.

Initially, engineers created a simple Python script to read alarms from:

plc_alarm.log

But over time, problems appeared:

Hardcoded file paths
Difficult to maintain
No logging system
No configuration support
No reusable modules
Difficult for teams to collaborate

Project Goal
Build a professional automation system that:
Reads PLC alarm logs
Detects ERROR alarms
Generates structured reports
Uses configuration files
Uses reusable modules
Implements logging
Produces maintainable code
